comment = "OpenEndpointSecurity userland client library and event logger"

desc = <<EOD
liboes, the userland client library for the oes(4) OpenEndpointSecurity
framework, and oeslogger(8), a passive NDJSON event logger.  Applications use
liboes to open a client, subscribe to security events, mute processes or
paths, and authorize or observe kernel security events delivered through the
MAC framework.
EOD
